% ADJ52 case-24 program (this patient's observations + queries only; no rules).
% 54-year-old man, progressive pancytopenia over months + bilateral foot
% paresthesias (a myeloneuropathy). Sleeve bariatric surgery years earlier, past
% heavy alcohol use, prior low zinc, and UNINTERRUPTED daily OTC zinc tablets.
% Serum B12 markedly elevated (>2000) on supplementation. Marrow: first biopsy
% hypercellular with dyserythropoiesis and NO clonal cytogenetic abnormality ->
% presumptive MDS, referred for transplant. Months later counts worse; repeat
% marrow now hypocellular with erythroid hyperplasia, persistent dyserythropoiesis,
% PROMINENT cytoplasmic vacuolization of erythroid AND myeloid precursors, and ring
% sideroblasts. No disease-directed therapy yet. Trace-metal labs never sent.

% --- the copper-deficiency marrow / blood gestalt (one correlated syndrome) ---
observe marrow_vacuolization(prominent)
observe marrow_ring_sideroblasts(present)
observe neutrophils(severely_reduced)
observe platelets(relatively_preserved)
observe anemia(macrocytic)

% --- copper-lowering exposures and malabsorptive anatomy ---
observe exposure(daily_zinc_supplementation)
observe history(bariatric_surgery)

% --- the B12-like neurologic manifestation ---
observe symptom(peripheral_neuropathy)

% --- marrow genetics / course ---
observe cytogenetics(normal_no_clonal_abnormality)
observe marrow_course(hypocellular_no_blast_excess)

% --- the prior-misattribution data (B12 already repleted; level now high) ---
observe serum_b12(markedly_elevated)
observe prior_treatment(b12_repletion_given)

% NOT observed (open, decision-relevant): serum_copper(...),
% copper_repletion_response(...) -- the conspicuously missing trace-metal labs.

% --- queries: each candidate diagnosis + the recommended next step ---
? diagnosis(copper_deficiency_myeloneuropathy)
? diagnosis(myelodysplastic_syndrome)
? diagnosis(vitamin_b12_deficiency)
? diagnosis(alcohol_related_marrow_suppression)
? next_step(serum_copper_ceruloplasmin_zinc_panel)
? next_step(marrow_molecular_sf3b1_cytogenetics)
